<h2>lol I tried making an app, but instead I'm just gonna write about coffee here</h2>

It's true, I got, like, seven days into learning how to code in Swift before I went, "Fuck this! My brain doesn't work that way!" So here I am, making more pages on my website. How quaint.<br><br>

Coffee has become a bigger and bigger part of my life in the last couple years as I started exploring the world of pourover. Now, I'm trying to refine my processes and share what I've learned.<br><br>

I guess I envision this area as serving as sort of a lil' diary. A place where I can document my coffee experiences, both with my brewing at home and the coffees I have out in the world.<br>
